        "answer": {
          "short": "$20$ years.",
          "worked": "There are $19$ ages.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Position}&=\\frac{19+1}{2}\\\\\\text{Position}&=10\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe first stem contains nine ages. The $10^{\\mathrm{th}}$ age is $2|0=20$, so the median age is $20$ years.",
